distributed actor references may be pointing at, logically, the same actor.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"resolve(id:using:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" multiple times, is not guaranteed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to return the same exact resolved actor instance, however all the references would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"represent logically references to the same distributed actor, e.g. on a different node.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Depending on the capabilities of the actor system producing the identifiers,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" may also be used to store instance specific metadata.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Synthesized-property","text":"Synthesized property","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In concrete distributed actor declarations, a witness for this protocol requirement is synthesized by the compiler.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It is not possible to assign a value to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id"},{"text":" directly; instead, it is assigned during an actors ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resolve"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the managing actor system.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/distributed\/distributedactor\/id"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Logical identity of this distributed actor."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Distributed\/DistributedActor\/id"},"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Distributed/DistributedActor/id":